+## 如何复验
+
+```sh
+swift run --package-path application-test feed-discover <SwiftVM-1.3.0.dmg>                       # declared …/releases/latest/download/appcast.xml
+swift run --package-path application-test feed-discover <SwiftVM-1.4.0-beta.37.dmg>               # 加 binding 前 NEEDS BINDING，加后 declared
+swift run --package-path application-test channel-verify <SwiftVM-1.2.0.dmg> --expect stable        # UPDATE → 1.3.0
+swift run --package-path application-test channel-verify <SwiftVM-1.4.0-beta.35.dmg> --expect beta  # UPDATE → 1.4.0-beta.37
+swift test --package-path DuoUpdaterCore --filter SwiftVMChannelTests
+```
